{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmeFuiEi9rXA68jMpYpa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**What I'd tell my friend:** I didn't decide anything. The page never told me what keeping my money in the עו\"ש actually costs me. If anything it made it look fine: the big number was \"74,044 ₪\", with \"דמי ניהול 0 ₪\". I'm not sure about any of it. Only later, lower down, it says money in the עו\"ש often gets no interest, so I don't get how it grows to 74k. The one thing I'm taking away is \"קרן כספית\": it's mentioned once as the thing to compare with. The next thing I'd tap is \"כסף שיושב בעו״ש\" in the top menu, because that's exactly my question.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Top of the page:** Heading \"חשבון עובר ושב\", so I was on the right page. Under it: \"כסף שיושב בו לא תמיד מקבל ריבית\". Then the big \"74,044 ₪\". I took that as what my money turns into after 10 years, and it stuck with me.\n- **The calculator:** I didn't touch anything. It's set to 10,000 ₪, not my 30,000. On the chart I read the numbers: \"מס 2,005 ₪\", \"דמי ניהול 0 ₪\", \"ההפקדות שלכם 62,681 ₪\". There were two lines on the chart, pink and a lighter one, with no labels next to them. I guessed one was without inflation, but I'm only guessing.\n- **\"למה משתמשים בזה\" / \"שווה לדעת\":** I caught \"מול קרן כספית יומית\" and \"פיקדונות, קרנות כספיות ומק״מ\". So other places exist, but the page doesn't say which one or how much more I'd earn.\n- **\"כמה זה עולה\":** It says \"דמי חשבון קבועים\", \"לפי התעריפון של הגורם המציע\". No shekel figure, so I still don't know what I'm paying.\n- **Taxes:** Three cards. I read the headings only.\n- **\"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\":** \"אין בישראל ביטוח פיקדונות\". That scared me a bit, my money's sitting there.\n- **The lock section and the glossary at the bottom:** I scrolled past.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** מק״מ, \"ריבית צמודה למדד\", \"ריאלית\", \"יתרת זכות\", the codes like \"BANK-20\" and \"TXI OQ11\", and \"חסום: שאלה פתוחה\".\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The 74,044 grows by \"5%\" a year on an account the page itself says usually pays no interest.\n- The cost is never in shekels.\n- Nothing says \"move X to Y\".\n- There was a dark red box I didn't read, and it put me off.\n\nAround the taxes section I was bored. By the glossary I'd have closed the page."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3686,"cache_read_input_tokens":13659,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3686},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"046ecc24-3ce8-4169-8a42-5cbafaae18e2","uuid":"9550f3fe-4f7c-453e-9342-0a85efb10030","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:04:49.200Z","request_id":"req_011CgmeFuVbZn4hRMNZbgDLm"}
